Tell me your name and prison number!

261
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:16,700
The number is FE18081
and my name is Gwess.

262
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:19,357
I'm just taking a walk
around the corridors.

263
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:23,557
If you don't have any business here,
get away from the gate and leave!

264
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,180
Sure, Mr. Guard.

265
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:35,220
There are four steel doors in here.

266
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:38,157
I wonder which one of them
leads to the control center.

267
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:39,997
And there are cameras in the corner.

268
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:40,910
Two of them.

269
00:15:42,780 --> 00:15:43,610
What the?

270
00:15:43,693 --> 00:15:44,900
Why is it so tight?

271
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,830
Suddenly...

272
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:50,970
Huh?

273
00:15:51,053 --> 00:15:52,597
What the hell was that sound just now?

274
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,327
Yeah, man, I heard that too.

275
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:55,650
It's close.

276
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:59,100
Oh crap, that's not good.

277
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,791
My body's getting bigger.

278
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,680
It was just a coffee maker.

279
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:04,657
Ain't that the sound it
makes when it's ready?

280
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:05,840
Nuh-uh. Damn it!

281
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:07,789
Why is this happening now?

282
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:09,810
Distance.

283
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:12,360
Is it because Guest left?

284
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,659
Is distance related to her ability?

285
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:17,920
I definitely heard it.

286
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:19,677
It's gotta be in here somewhere.

287
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,140
Shit, shit, shit!

288
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,233
It's coming from there!

289
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,360
Hey, get out of the way! Move it!

290
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,555
That's freaking hard!

291
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:31,500
Dammit, YB!

292
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:34,610
Huh?

293
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:38,677
I told you idiots it was the coffee
maker, but you wouldn't listen!

294
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:39,590
My bad.

295
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,320
Screw this investigation!

296
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:46,526
I have to fit through the bars
before my body grows any bigger!

297
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:53,160
What the hell?

298
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:57,160
G. G. Dolph.

299
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,820
This thing is...

300
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:26,057
G... G...

301
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:27,060
So creepy.

302
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:29,697
It seems like a doll,
but it's transparent.

303
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:31,037
Same as my thread.

304
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:35,157
It's a physical manifestation of
Gwess' energy that no one else can see!

305
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,760
How about GG dolls?

306
00:17:37,260 --> 00:17:40,057
Yes, that will be the
name of my mental ability.

307
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:42,277
This baby doll from hell is what shrunk me

308
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:45,066
and ripped the guard and
the parrot to pieces!

309
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:50,457
That must mean it was just chilling
inside the rat with me the entire time!

310
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:54,697
And I'm willing to bet that Gwess has no
idea her ability weakens if she's far away,

311
00:17:54,780 --> 00:17:57,309
so she doesn't know my
body's growing back!

312
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,957
Now I've got a murderous
munchkin chasing me

313
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:02,157
down because it thinks
that I was running away.

314
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:05,416
If I don't get out of here,
the thing's gonna kill me!

315
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:12,340
Gee. Damn it.

316
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:13,880
Gee, Dolph.

317
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:17,165
What did I ever do to
deserve a fate like this?

318
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:18,477
This is how I go out?

319
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:19,560
By this creature?

320
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,520
I can't get through!

321
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:32,760
G, G, G, G.

322
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,540
A thread.

323
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:00,526
No, a whole clump of threads.

324
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:07,040
This must be the form that
my energy takes. A clump.

325
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:11,237
When they gather in clump,
it becomes three-dimensional.

326
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,400
What a concept!

327
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:18,137
Scream your heart out, bastard child!

328
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:20,520
Now call Gwess over here and hurry up!

329
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:26,320
Jolene, I wasn't expecting you to
also have an ability. Come here!

330
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:28,380
Wait a second,

331
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:32,217
please, Jolene, I'm begging you, stop
strangling my Gigi doll so tightly!

332
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:33,497
Hey, I don't want to hear it.

333
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:36,457
Focus on shrinking my body enough
so I can squeeze out of here,

334
00:19:36,540 --> 00:19:38,097
but only just a little, got it?

335
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:41,057
Okay, okay, you can even
have the bottom bunk, too.

336
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:44,437
I know we've been through a
lot, but please don't hate me.

337
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:47,697
Still, though, I'd like you to speak
to me all cutesy from time to time.

338
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:49,486
Just hurry and do it already!

339
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:57,537
All right now hand over the amulet that
includes the stone inside and I want to know

340
00:19:57,620 --> 00:20:02,457
who you bought it from too of course whatever
you say that'll be two hundred dollars

341
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:04,757
shut the fuck up you
bitch just tell me the

342
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:07,457
name before I kill you okay I got it well

343
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:09,997
I'm not sure but I think her name was

344
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:15,140
Hermes Hermes I don't
know her that well here

345
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:22,770
Kidding

346
00:20:27,420 --> 00:20:28,250
Gotcha!

347
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:30,280
Oh, Mr. Guard!

348
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,560
Hurry, come here!

349
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:34,136
There's a prisoner past the gunpoint!

350
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:36,440
Hurry up and get over here!

351
00:20:38,060 --> 00:20:40,472
Hey you, the hell are you doing in there?

352
00:20:41,540 --> 00:20:43,187
How'd you get past the door?

353
00:20:46,560 --> 00:20:47,390
Prison break!

354
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:48,520
Code 999!

355
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:55,022
This is gonna be the end of you!

356
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:57,757
If you didn't know, that guard
just went to pick up his shotgun,

357
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:01,117
and since you're behind the door,
he's got the right to shoot your ass!

358
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,900
No questions asked!

359
00:21:03,580 --> 00:21:04,410
Jillian!

360
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:06,857
I'd say it's just what you deserve!

361
00:21:06,940 --> 00:21:10,116
You hurt my feelings, and
now you're gonna die for it!

362
00:21:11,840 --> 00:21:14,580
Good freaking grief, Quest. Shut up.

363
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:17,995
And listen, you said everything
has a name, didn't you?

364
00:21:18,180 --> 00:21:20,004
Then I'll name my ability, too.

365
00:21:20,380 --> 00:21:21,860
It'll be Stone Ocean.

366
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:25,617
Because somehow I'm going to free
myself from the Sea of Stone.

367
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:26,960
Did you hear me?

368
00:21:27,840 --> 00:21:28,840
Stone Ocean.

369
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,101
That's the name.

370
00:21:31,560 --> 00:21:32,390
Hold on!

371
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:41,817
If there's some sort of
hierarchy in this prison,

372
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:43,617
then I'll follow it as much as I need to.

373
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:46,497
But I'm the one who's going
to be giving out orders here.

374
00:21:46,580 --> 00:21:50,051
Now shrink me down and get me
the hell out of this hallway.

375
00:21:50,900 --> 00:21:51,730
Huh?

376
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:53,700
Hold on, where did she go?

377
00:21:55,100 --> 00:21:56,640
She's gone. Huh?

378
00:21:57,180 --> 00:21:59,062
Are you really sure you saw her?

379
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:01,927
Well, yeah, but I only
saw her from the back.

380
00:22:02,340 --> 00:22:03,170
Weird.

381
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:14,640
Hold the man.

382
00:22:26,740 --> 00:22:30,197
Although you think I cope,

383
00:22:30,280 --> 00:22:35,537
my head is filled with hope.

384
00:22:35,620 --> 00:22:39,977
Of some place

385
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:43,720
other than here

386
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:50,140
Although you think I smile

387
00:22:51,740 --> 00:22:55,240
Inside and all the while

388
00:22:56,980 --> 00:23:03,340
I'm wondering about my destiny

389
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:07,837
I'm thinking

390
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:13,517
about all the

391
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:18,397
things I'd like

392
00:23:18,480 --> 00:23:24,360
to do in my life.

393
00:23:25,900 --> 00:23:29,320
I'm a dreamer

394
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:34,420
A distant dreamer

395
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:39,540
Dreaming far away

396
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:44,480
From today

397
00:23:54,360 --> 00:23:55,190
Thank you.

398
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,160
Thank you.
